OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity 'looking into' street  
OL,4,Aparty near campus                      
OL,6,FA university says it is looking into   
OL,7,Fwhether students breached its code of  
OL,8,Fconduct after a street party close to  
OL,9,Fits campus in Londonderry.             
OL,11,FFootage on social media showed hundreds
OL,12,Fof young people dancing in an alleyway 
OL,13,Fin the Argyle Street area of Derry -   
OL,14,Fclose to Ulster University's campus in 
OL,15,Fthe city - on Wednesday night.         
OL,17,FPolice and the local community safety  
OL,18,Fwardens responded to reports of the    
OL,19,Fparty, although police said no one     
OL,20,Fcould be located in the area.          
