OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity 'looking into' street  
OL,4,Aparty near campus                      
OL,6,FAn Ulster University (UU) spokesperson 
OL,7,Fsaid it takes concerns about antisocial
OL,8,Fbehaviour seriously, adding it is      
OL,9,F"looking into what happened, in line   
OL,10,Fwith University policies and           
OL,11,Fprocedures".                           
